      "is_best": true,
      "html": "<div class=\"post__content post__content--new-editor\"><p>Hello,</p><p>This error has been introduced in revision 4 issued in 2018. Missing link from SYSCLK line shall go to line named SYSCLK:</p><figure><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://uploads-eu-west-1.insided.com/stmicroelectronics-en/attachment/ad969d09-5b4e-486e-8dc9-7332295c87db.png\"/></figure><p>That will be fixed when a new revision of the document is planned for release. As this product is considered as fully mature, the document will take a considerable time for update.</p></div>"
